      "text": "Cross-cutting configuration & token contract — organization, persona, workflow, care setting, terminology pack, and branding come from config, not hardcoded logic.\nHarborlight Children's Hospital is the EXAMPLE-ONLY configuration. Secrets, tenant IDs, and endpoints live in separate environment bindings and are never committed.",
